# Day 12 – EV ADAS System Integration & Testing

## Objective

Day 12 focuses on integrating the EV control, ADAS, fault management,
UART shell, and Python dashboard modules into one complete system.

## Modules Integrated

- EV Control
- ADAS
- Ultrasonic sensors
- Fault management
- Finite State Machine
- UART command shell
- Python EV dashboard

## ADAS Features

- Forward Collision Warning
- Critical Collision Warning
- Blind Spot Detection
- Time To Collision (TTC)
- Overspeed Detection
- Alarm priority handling
- Hysteresis-based alarm clearing

## Fault Handling

The system monitors:

- Motor over-temperature
- Low battery SOC
- Critical collision

When a critical fault occurs:

- EV state changes to FAULT
- Motor torque is set to zero
- PWM output is disabled
- Fault LED is activated

